eated_at":"2026-02-03T15:32:24Z","updated_at":"2026-02-03T15:32:24Z","body":"> For a dense fog, the grid looks quite strange:\r\n\r\nGizmos and grid are already set to ignore fog in `master`, so I'm not sure that's the issue.\r\n\r\nThat said, rendering gizmos in a separate viewport will break any depth-related effects, causing them to always render in front of everything. This is bound to look confusing in large scenes with lots of overdraw. Depth perception is often pretty important when you're trying to place things in the 3D world.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3842029385/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3842116685","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115821#issuecomment-3842116685","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115821","id":3842116685,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7lAgxN","user":{"login":"marcinn","id":139032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcinn","html_url":"https://github.com/marcinn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcinn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcinn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcinn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcinn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcinn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcinn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcinn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcinn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcinn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-03T15:49:05Z","updated_at":"2026-02-03T15:49:17Z","body":"> This is bound to look confusing in large scenes with lots of overdraw. \r\n\r\nI saw your comments in the proposal and I am aware of that.\r\nThat's why I included this improvement as an option.\r\n\r\nBut I'm also thinking about using z-buffer of the main viewport. \r\nI don't know how to do that, yet...\r\n\r\n> Gizmos and grid are already set to ignore fog in master,\r\n\r\nFog is not enough... :/\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3842116685/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3842617392","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115821#issuecomment-3842617392","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115821","id":3842617392,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7lCbAw","user":{"login":"jcostello","id":1168582,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjg1ODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1168582?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello","html_url":"https://github.com/jcostello","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/received_events","